NEXUS v2.6.0 release intent

Boundary: bounded storage failure and request continuity
Invariants:
- A_out <= A_in
- evidence != authority
- request marker reservation precedes constitutional delegation
- torn or interrupted reservation recovers as Indeterminate, never Accepted

Require on the exact candidate:
- canonical NEXUS Verification: SUCCESS
- NEXUS v2.6 verification: SUCCESS
- exact-candidate evidence attestation: VERIFIED
- extracted evidence-member SHA-256 self-audit: PASS
- reserve-before-delegate contract preserved
- crash/torn-write recovers Indeterminate
- ENOSPC / storage failure fails closed before delegation

No real verification -> no PASS -> no seal.
Production mutation: false
Authority expansion: NONE
